{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56992","headline":"中宗时人爲李元恭语（题拟） · 佚名","name":"中宗时人爲李元恭语（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长宁安乐幷狂颠，既教翻地亦翻天。\n卖弄大家犹未足，便使元恭来取钱。\n（《册府元龟》卷六三八《铨选部·贪贿》。\n此首及下首承陶敏先生见告）（〖1〗《册府元龟》云：「李元恭中宗时以大理少卿爲长宁、安乐二公主所引用，令知吏部侍郎，分往东都掌选事，亦以赃污闻於天下。\n故时人爲之语曰〖语略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}